<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραῖος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span> also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Ant.</u>
			867
		</span></i> (lyr.): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρά</span>): <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>prayed to</i> or <i>entreated,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ἀ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκέσιος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1182
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prayed against, accursed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γονά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1565
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότμος ἀ. ἐκ πατρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					898
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ᾽ ἀραῖον ἔλαβες</span>
			you adjured me <i>under a curse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				276
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>cursing, bringing mischief upon,</i> c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόγγος ἀ. οἴκοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					237
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόμοις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1291
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				608
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IT</u>
				778
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γονεὺς ἐκγόνοις ὡς οὐδεὶς ἕτερος
					ἄλλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					931c
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1398
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1202
			</span></i>.—Almost confined to Trag., exc. Pl.l.c.</div>
